{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>華潤置地上月合同銷售額155億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>按年下跌近一成二，按月跌幅一成六，首9個月累計，合同銷售1,646億元人民幣，按年上升逾百分之6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:03.145715+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.390065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.390065+00:00","content_hash":"99dcab60729bb0648bee5af6fb1ddee3de9ce913e7f917e215089400310de73d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}